1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,800
First of all, we make this look easy.

2
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:06,120
Us black girls with all kinds of curls

3
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:07,660
smelling the cocoa butter out here

4
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:09,960
every damn day saving the world.

5
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:13,280
Time and time again, we find the ways and means

6
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:15,800
between packing lunches, planning launches,

7
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:21,820
and patting weaves to get information to save information.

8
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:23,200
Girl, you heard what they saying?

9
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:24,680
Ain't no games to be playing.

10
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:27,420
So we show up and show out and turn up and turn

11
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:31,700
this mother out and flip it and yasmin'.

12
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:34,980
Throw side eyes, gather, get folks all the way together

13
00:00:34,980 --> 00:00:38,580
with edges still in place, skin-defying time and space.

14
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:40,240
They call it black girl magic

15
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:44,660
because ain't no way to explain our amazing grace.

16
00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:50,530
Sound of a black girl's point of view.

17
00:00:50,890 --> 00:00:53,230
Knowing that nobody does it like we do, boo.

18
00:00:53,570 --> 00:00:55,510
Pride in our power, strengthen our strides.

19
00:00:55,590 --> 00:00:58,890
You can attempt to imitate, but soul, you cannot buy.

20
00:00:58,890 --> 00:01:03,010
We work twice as hard and must be twice as perfect.

21
00:01:03,350 --> 00:01:06,330
Purveyors of potent truths we deliver in small doses

22
00:01:06,330 --> 00:01:08,330
because folks is shook when she's moving.

23
00:01:08,550 --> 00:01:09,750
Oh no, it's another.

24
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:12,500
Bump that.

25
00:01:12,960 --> 00:01:13,840
We're not hostile.

26
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:14,820
We're passionate.

27
00:01:15,320 --> 00:01:16,920
Clapping back is our way of declaring

28
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:19,000
we ain't having it.

29
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,880
They go low, we go high.

30
00:01:23,980 --> 00:01:25,500
They say no, we defy.

31
00:01:25,580 --> 00:01:26,780
They didn't want us to read.

32
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,640
Kept us out of libraries they built.

33
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:30,580
Now we are the biggest buyers of books

34
00:01:30,580 --> 00:01:32,920
so we can read you for filth.

35
00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:39,050
Our magic is in our love and tears,

36
00:01:39,270 --> 00:01:41,310
our fears and our flyness,

37
00:01:41,670 --> 00:01:43,690
our sisterhoods and insecurities,

38
00:01:43,970 --> 00:01:46,150
our ride or don't even try yet.

39
00:01:46,650 --> 00:01:50,270
We are not the one and still we rise.

40
00:01:50,510 --> 00:01:52,790
This here is for colored girls

41
00:01:52,790 --> 00:01:54,570
who've considered getting your life

42
00:01:54,570 --> 00:01:57,730
and are reclaiming our time.

43
00:01:57,730 --> 00:01:57,850
Thank you.

